    "text": "Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissum gewrite \u00fe\u00e6t an scirgemot s\u00e6t \u00e6t \u00e6gelno\u00f0es stane be Cnutes d\u00e6ge Cinges.\n\u00de\u00e6r s\u00e6ton \u00c6\u00f0elstan biscop.\n& Ranig Ealdorman & Edwine \u00fe\u00e6s ealdormannes & Leofwine Wulsiges sunu & \u00deurcill Hwita.\n& Tofig Pruda com \u00fe\u00e6r on \u00fe\u00e6s Cinges \u00e6rende.\n& \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s Bryning scirgerefa & \u00c6gelgeard \u00e6t Frome & Leofwine \u00e6t Frome & Godric \u00e6t Stoce & ealle\n\u00dea com \u00fe\u00e6r farende to \u00feam gemote Edwine Enneawnes sunu & sp\u00e6c \u00fe\u00e6r on his agene modor \u00e6fter\n\u00dea acsode \u00fee bisceop hwa sceolde andswerian for his moder.\n\u00dea andsweorode \u00deurcil Hwita & s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde gif he \u00fea talu cu\u00f0e.\n\u00dea he \u00f0a talu na ne cu\u00f0e, \u00fea sceawode man \u00fereo \u00feegnas of \u00feam gemote \u00fe\u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6r heo w\u00e6s, & \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s Leofwine \u00e6t Frome & \u00c6gelsig \u00fee Reada & winsige Sc\u00e6g\u00f0man, & \u00fea \u00f0a heo to hire comon \u00fea\n\u00dea s\u00e6de heo \u00fe\u00e6t heo nan land n\u00e6fde \u00fee him aht to gebyrede.\n& gebealh heo swi\u00f0e eorlice wi\u00f0 hire sunu & gecleopode \u00f0a Leoffl\u00e6de hire magan to hire \u00deurcilles wif\n& heo sy\u00f0\u00f0an to \u00feam \u00feegnon cw\u00e6\u00f0, do\u00f0 \u00feegnlice & wel abeoda\u00f0 mine \u00e6rende to \u00f0am gemote beforan\nAnd heo \u00f0a sw\u00e6 dydon, ridon to \u00f0am gemote & cyddon eallon \u00feam godan mannum hw\u00e6t heo on heom\n\u00dea astod \u00feurcill hwita up on \u00feam gemote & b\u00e6d ealle \u00fea \u00f0egnas syllan his wife \u00fea land cl\u00e6ne \u00fee hire\n& \u00deurcill rad \u00f0a to sancte \u00c6\u00f0elberhtes mynstre be ealles \u00fe\u00e6s folces leafe & gewitnesse & let settan on",
